{"2909450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Don't Peek Out", "steam_appid": 2909450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909450/extras/3f96b06932ab214959cb9a1975d74936.avif?t=1777837738\" width=1560 height=501 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A house that doesn’t feel like home, shadows stretched across endless corridors, whispers and echoes through the walls. Four children must gather candles and seal ancient runes before sunrise. One player becomes the monster—relentless, twisted, and willing to do anything to break free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a race against time: dawn lasts only minutes, and e<i>very second brings you closer to survival… or capture.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909450/extras/981a67af7fa8dc24cf39001fd7f4621c.webp?t=1777837738\" width=721 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a maze-like house where nothing feels safe for long. Search drawers for supplies, heal fallen friends, and hide under fragile blankets that won’t last forever. Use teamwork, strategy, and quick thinking to outsmart the creature stalking you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909450/extras/11aec2d9dbbcd28f179ce7ef54151af0.avif?t=1777837738\" width=1560 height=284 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909450/extras/7c7e57e3a41531f9246be577c31f99af.webp?t=1777837738\" width=721 height=61 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a child, gather candles to activate runes and seal the monster before dawn. As the monster, use all its super-natural abilities to gain advantages and track, stun, and capture every last player. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Two roles. Two ways to win.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909450/extras/e5a71b2c4b4043e234a02b4684303ada.webp?t=1777837738\" width=721 height=61 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No nights are the same. Runes, candles, and hiding spots change with every game, forcing both sides to adapt. <u>Every move counts.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909450/extras/a51884be487b35dd190ee533d3c6c761.avif?t=1777837738\" width=1560 height=284 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909450/extras/f59601de775b625e05c1f8cc3d2c7bdc.webp?t=1777837738\" width=721 height=61 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house itself tells the story of an archaeologist consumed by his discovery. Old notes, broken photos, and strange relics whisper fragments of the past. The deeper you look, the more you realise what really happened here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909450/extras/9066c6c6521af6c9cc16f4fb034e7941.avif?t=1777837738\" width=1560 height=644 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909450/extras/3f96b06932ab214959cb9a1975d74936.avif?t=1777837738\" width=1560 height=501 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A house that doesn’t feel like home, shadows stretched across endless corridors, whispers and echoes through the walls. Four children must gather candles and seal ancient runes before sunrise. One player becomes the monster—relentless, twisted, and willing to do anything to break free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a race against time: dawn lasts only minutes, and e<i>very second brings you closer to survival… or capture.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909450/extras/981a67af7fa8dc24cf39001fd7f4621c.webp?t=1777837738\" width=721 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a maze-like house where nothing feels safe for long. Search drawers for supplies, heal fallen friends, and hide under fragile blankets that won’t last forever. Use teamwork, strategy, and quick thinking to outsmart the creature stalking you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909450/extras/11aec2d9dbbcd28f179ce7ef54151af0.avif?t=1777837738\" width=1560 height=284 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909450/extras/7c7e57e3a41531f9246be577c31f99af.webp?t=1777837738\" width=721 height=61 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a child, gather candles to activate runes and seal the monster before dawn. As the monster, use all its super-natural abilities to gain advantages and track, stun, and capture every last player. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Two roles. Two ways to win.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909450/extras/e5a71b2c4b4043e234a02b4684303ada.webp?t=1777837738\" width=721 height=61 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No nights are the same. Runes, candles, and hiding spots change with every game, forcing both sides to adapt. <u>Every move counts.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909450/extras/a51884be487b35dd190ee533d3c6c761.avif?t=1777837738\" width=1560 height=284 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909450/extras/f59601de775b625e05c1f8cc3d2c7bdc.webp?t=1777837738\" width=721 height=61 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house itself tells the story of an archaeologist consumed by his discovery. Old notes, broken photos, and strange relics whisper fragments of the past. The deeper you look, the more you realise what really happened here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909450/extras/9066c6c6521af6c9cc16f4fb034e7941.avif?t=1777837738\" width=1560 height=644 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "An asymmetrical survival game where strategy, and trust collide. Players navigate a mazed house, gather objects and seal ancient runes before dawn breaks. Something hunts them in the dark and it won’t stop until every player is caught. Will you outsmart the monster, or embrace the shadows as one?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</stron